Vendored from https://github.com/snuri00/ps2-web-recomp (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Samir Nuri):
runtime/src/iop/*, runtime/src/disc.cpp, runtime/include/ps2/{disc,state}.hpp.
Local changes: IOP SIF wakes queue threads that sleep in their own server loop and implements
sceSifGetNextRequest/sceSifExecRequest (needed by EA SNDDRV). Shim headers in include/ps2/{memory,system}.hpp
and src/hw.hpp adapt it to the hp runtime (runtime/iop_bridge.cpp).
